    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mark Kelly & Associates are delighted to present 15 Tully Green, an exceptional former show house extending over the ground and first floors with the added benefit of a private garage. Built in 2024, this contemporary home combines stylish design, spacious accommodation, and outstanding energy efficiency, boasting an impressive A2 BER rating for enhanced comfort, lower energy costs, and sustainable living.\r\n\r\nPresented in turnkey condition, this beautifully finished home has been thoughtfully designed to maximise natural light and create a bright, welcoming atmosphere throughout. The entrance hall leads to a generously proportioned living room, providing the perfect space for relaxing or entertaining. The reception room benefits from access to a private patio area, creating an extension of the living space and an ideal setting for outdoor dining. To the rear, the contemporary kitchen/dining room features high-quality cabinetry, generous worktop space, and a practical utility area, while a convenient guest cloakroom completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises two spacious double bedrooms, including a superb principal bedroom complete with a walk-in wardrobe and a stylish en suite shower room. A beautifully appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedroom, with all bathrooms finished to an exceptional standard. A standout feature of this home is the private garage, providing secure parking together with valuable additional storage. In addition, there is provision for a second off-street parking space directly in front of the garage, offering added convenience.\r\n\r\nSituated within the highly regarded Tully Green development in Laughanstown, the property enjoys an enviable location close to Cherrywood, Cabinteely, Foxrock and Shankill, with an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, schools, parks and leisure amenities all within easy reach. Ideally located within an 8–10 minute walk of both Cherrywood and Laughanstown Luas stops, providing excellent connectivity to Sandyford, Dundrum and Dublin City Centre while the nearby M50 and N11 provide excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy the extensive network of parks and walking trails throughout Cherrywood, including the nearby Tully Park, Ticknick Park and Beckett Park, offering playgrounds, sports areas, walking routes and open green spaces for all ages. The wider area also provides easy access to established amenities including Cabinteely Park, coastal walks at Dún Laoghaire, and the Dublin Mountains, providing endless opportunities for outdoor pursuits.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly well served for families, with Cherrywood Educate Together National School located close by at Tully Park, while a number of established primary and secondary schools are within easy reach, including St. Colmcille’s National Schools, St Laurence College, Cabinteely Community School, and other highly regarded schools throughout south Dublin."
      },
